&lt;/div>&lt;p>然后生成序列化字符串&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>CB链</title><link>https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cb%E9%93%BE/</link><pubDate>Thu, 07 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cb%E9%93%BE/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cb%E9%93%BE/1_hu_b8a60240711ff2f8.webp" alt="Featured image of post CB链" />&lt;h1 id="cb链">CB链
