&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">org&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">apache&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">commons&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">collections&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">functors&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">ChainedTransformer&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">transform&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">org&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">apache&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">commons&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">collections&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">functors&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">InvokerTransformer&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">transform&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">java&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">lang&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">reflect&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">Method&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">invoke&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">sun&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">reflect&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">DelegatingMethodAccessorImpl&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">invoke&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">sun&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">reflect&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">NativeMethodAccessorImpl&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">invoke&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">sun&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">reflect&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">NativeMethodAccessorImpl&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">invoke0&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">java&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">lang&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">Runtime&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">exec&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="o">*/&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>同样LazyMap之后的完全一样，变的是调用LazyMap的get方法的方式&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>CC2链</title><link>https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc2%E9%93%BE/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc2%E9%93%BE/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc2%E9%93%BE/1_hu_87e9d3b8500e4a89.webp" alt="Featured image of post CC2链" />&lt;h1 id="cc2链">CC2链
&lt;/h1>&lt;h2 id="环境准备">环境准备
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>跟CC4一样&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="链子分析">链子分析
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>跟CC4唯一区别在于加载字节码的过程不同&lt;/p>
&lt;p>CC2链不再使用Transformer数组来利用InstantiateTransformer将TrAXFilter类初始化，而是直接使用InvokerTransformer来调用TemplatesImpl.newTransformer()方法，这是为了在shiro漏洞等地方，他们会重写加载数组的方法&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>CC5链</title><link>https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc5%E9%93%BE/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc5%E9%93%BE/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc5%E9%93%BE/1_hu_1c06a04c97e4393e.webp" alt="Featured image of post CC5链" />&lt;h1 id="cc5链">CC5链
&lt;/h1>&lt;h2 id="链子分析">链子分析
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>先看yso上的链子&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">13
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">14
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">15
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">16
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">17
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">18
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">19
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">20
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">21
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">/*
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Gadget chain:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ObjectInputStream.readObject()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> BadAttributeValueExpException.readObject()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> TiedMapEntry.toString()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> LazyMap.get()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ChainedTransformer.transform()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ConstantTransformer.transform()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> InvokerTransformer.transform()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Method.invoke()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Class.getMethod()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> InvokerTransformer.transform()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Method.invoke()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Runtime.getRuntime()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> InvokerTransformer.transform()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Method.invoke()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Runtime.exec()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Requires:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> commons-collections
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> */
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>这里不用commons-collections4了，可以看到LazyMap之后的链子完全跟前面CC6部分一样&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>CC4链</title><link>https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc4%E9%93%BE/</link><pubDate>Thu, 31 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc4%E9%93%BE/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc4%E9%93%BE/1_hu_4ae1857bdb770819.webp" alt="Featured image of post CC4链" />&lt;h1 id="cc4链">CC4链
&lt;/h1>&lt;h2 id="环境搭建">环境搭建
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>&lt;strong>jdk8u65&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Commons-Collections 4.0&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>cc4.0的maven依赖导入&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-xml" data-lang="xml">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;dependency&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;groupId&amp;gt;&lt;/span>org.apache.commons&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/groupId&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;artifactId&amp;gt;&lt;/span>commons-collections4&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/artifactId&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;version&amp;gt;&lt;/span>4.0&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/version&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nt">&amp;lt;/dependency&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>这边建议直接把3.2.1直接注释了，不然IDEA的查找用法会很奇怪&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="链子分析">链子分析
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>跟完前面的链子我们发现他们的终点都是一样的，要么反射调用来执行，要么动态加载字节码&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>CC3链</title><link>https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc3%E9%93%BE/</link><pubDate>Tue, 29 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc3%E9%93%BE/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc3%E9%93%BE/1_hu_a70b56a612ce4b2c.webp" alt="Featured image of post CC3链" />&lt;h1 id="cc3链">CC3链
&lt;/h1>&lt;p>CC3与CC1和CC6不同的地方在于，他是通过动态加载字节码来实现的，而后面两条链是通过 &lt;code>Runtime.exec()&lt;/code> 进行命令执行的，容易被ban&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="构建环境">构建环境
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>&lt;strong>jdk8u65&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Commons-Collections 3.2.1&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="templatesimpl-解析">TemplatesImpl 解析
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>我们知道&lt;code>TemplatesImpl&lt;/code>是⼀个可以加载字节码的类，通过调用其&lt;code>newTransformer()&lt;/code>方法，即可执行这段字节码的类构造器&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>CC6链</title><link>https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc6%E9%93%BE/</link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc6%E9%93%BE/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://0d000721999.github.io/p/cc6%E9%93%BE/1_hu_8f9b10bf2c87c368.webp" alt="Featured image of post CC6链" />&lt;h1 id="cc6链">CC6链
&lt;/h1>&lt;p>全版本可用&lt;/p>
&lt;p>在jdk8u71修复了CC1链后，出现CC6链&lt;/p>
&lt;p>这条链不受版本限制&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="环境搭建">环境搭建
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>&lt;strong>jdk8u71&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Comoons-Collections 3.2.1&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="链子分析">链子分析
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>先看yso利用链&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> Gadget chain:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> java.io.ObjectInputStream.readObject()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> java.util.HashSet.readObject()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> java.util.HashMap.put()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> java.util.HashMap.hash()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> org.apache.commons.collections.keyvalue.TiedMapEntry.hashCode()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> org.apache.commons.collections.keyvalue.TiedMapEntry.getValue()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> org.apache.commons.collections.map.LazyMap.get()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> org.apache.commons.collections.functors.ChainedTransformer.transform()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> org.apache.commons.collections.functors.InvokerTransformer.transform()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> java.lang.reflect.Method.invoke()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> java.lang.Runtime.exec()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>后面部分看起来跟LazyMap一样，前半部分跟URLDNS一样，就中间不同&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>